00:04:53.248 --> 00:04:56.088
Wreck-It Ralph is a giant of a man

00:04:56.168 --> 00:04:59.288
Nine feet tall with really big hands

00:04:59.368 --> 00:05:02.408
Living in a stump on his very own land

00:05:02.488 --> 00:05:05.768
Until his world went crazy

00:05:05.848 --> 00:05:09.288
He was minding his own business
on the day they came

00:05:09.368 --> 00:05:12.728
They showed a piece of paper
saying "eminent domain"

00:05:12.808 --> 00:05:16.008
They built an apartment building
saying progress was to blame

00:05:16.088 --> 00:05:19.528
So he got mad
And he turned bad

00:05:19.608 --> 00:05:22.848
Brick by brick
he's gonna take his land back

00:05:22.928 --> 00:05:26.048
Wreck it, Wreck-It Ralph
As fast as you can

00:05:26.168 --> 00:05:29.328
You know you can do it
with your colossal hands

00:05:29.408 --> 00:05:32.608
So don't let Fix-It Felix
and that building stand

00:05:32.688 --> 00:05:36.008
I wreck it
I fix it

00:05:36.088 --> 00:05:39.528
I wreck it
I fix it

00:05:41.768 --> 00:05:43.048
You fixed it!

00:05:50.008 --> 00:05:52.848
