00:05:56.088 --> 00:05:59.488
Not just a superintendent
He's a super super guy

00:05:59.568 --> 00:06:02.568
And everybody loves him

00:06:02.888 --> 00:06:06.168
With his trusty tool belt
and steel-toed shoes

00:06:06.288 --> 00:06:09.448
Nicelanders believe
that Felix just can't lose

00:06:09.528 --> 00:06:12.728
So when Wreck-It Ralph
starts to come unglued

00:06:12.808 --> 00:06:15.888
He doesn't get mad
'Cause he's so rad

00:06:16.248 --> 00:06:19.528
Brick by brick he's gonna build it back

00:06:19.608 --> 00:06:22.568
Fix it, Fix-It Felix, as fast as you can

00:06:22.648 --> 00:06:26.008
Use the magic hammer
